! \(n + j\)!} \\nonumber\\\\ & =& \(-1\)^{\(n\ - 1\) / 2} \\frac{\\pi}{2} \\left\( x^n + y^n \\right\) e\(-xy, n\) \\nonumber\\\\ & =& \\int_0^\\pi \\frac{\\sin \\left\( x e^{i \\theta} + y e^{-i \\theta} \\right\) + \\sin \\left\( x e^{-i \\theta} + y e^{i \\theta} \\right\)}{2} \\cos n \\theta \\, \d \\theta \\nonumber\\\\ & =& \\int_0^\\pi \\sin \\left\( \(x + y\) \\frac{e^{i \\theta} + e^{-i \\theta}}{2} \\right\) \\cos \\left\( \(x - y\) \\frac{e^{i \\theta} - e^{-i \\theta}}{2} \\right\) \\cos n \\theta \\, d \\theta \\nonumber\\\\ & =& \\int_0^\\\pi \\sin \\left\( \(x + y\) \\cos \\theta \\right\) \\cos \\left\( i\(x - y\) \\sin \\theta \\right\) \\cos n \\theta \\, d \\theta \\nonumber\\\\ & =& \\int_0^\\pi \\sin \\left\( \(x + y\) \\cos \\theta \\right\) \\cosh \\left\( \(x - y\) \\sin \\theta\ \\right\) \\cos n \\theta \\, d \\theta.\\eALT{} )/Border[0 0 0]/K 49/P 9102 0 R/Pg 1088 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj9106 0 obj<</K 0/P 9102 0 R/Pg 1091 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj9107 0 obj<</K 3/P 9102 0 R/Pg 1091 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj9108 0 obj<</K[6 9110 0 R 9 9111 0 R 11 9112 0 R 13]/P 9102 0 R/Pg 1091 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj9109 0 obj<</ActualText(\\bUnALT{} \\begin{aligned} & \\int_0^{\\pi} \\sin \\left\(\(x + y\) \\cos \\theta \\right\) \\cosh \\left\( \(x - y\) \\sin \\theta \\right\) \\cos n \\theta \\, d \\theta \\\\ & = \\int_0^{\\pi} \\sin \\left\(\(x + y\) \\cos \\theta \\right\) \\cosh \\l\eft\( \(x - y\) \\sin \\theta \\right\) \\cos \(-n \\theta\) \\, d \\theta \\\\ & = \(-1\)^{\(-n - 1\) / 2} \\frac{\\pi}{2} \\left\(x^{-n} + y^{-n} \\right\) e\(-xy, -n\) \\\\ & = \(-1\)^{\(-n - 1\) / 2} \\frac{\\pi}{2} \\left\(x^{-n} + y^{-n} \\right\) \(\-1\)^n \(xy\)^n e\(-xy, n\) \\\\ & = \(-1\)^{\(n - 1\) / 2} \\frac{\\pi}{2} \\left\(x^n + y^n \\right\) e\(-xy, n\). \\end{aligned}\\eUnALT{} )/Border[0 0 0]/K 14/P 9102 0 R/Pg 1091 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj9110 0 obj<</ActualText(n \\in -\(2 \\mathbb{N} - 1\))/K 