gin{aligned} & e\(ix, n\) = \\frac{2}{\\pi \(1 + i^n x^n\)} \\int_0^{\\pi} e^ {\(ix + 1\) \\cos \\theta} \\cos \\left\( \(ix - 1\) \\sin \\theta \\right\) \\cos n \\theta d \\theta \\\\ \\iff & \\cos\(x, n\) + i \\sin\(x, n\) \\\\\ & = \\frac{2}{\\pi \(1 + i^n x^n\)} \\int_0^{\\pi} e^ {ix \\cos \\theta} \\cos \\left\( ix \\sin \\theta - \\sin \\theta \\right\) e^{\\cos \\theta} \\cos n \\theta \\, d \\theta \\\\ & = \\frac{2}{\\pi \(1 + i^n x^n\)} \\int_0^{\\pi} \(\\cos \(x \\c\os \\theta\) + i \\sin\(x \\cos \\theta\)\) \\\\ & \\qquad \(\\cos\( ix \\sin \\theta\) \\cos \(\\sin \\theta\) + \\sin \(ix \\sin \\theta\) \\sin\(\\sin \\theta\) \) e^{\\cos \\theta} \\cos n \\theta \\, d \\theta \\\\ & = \\frac{2}{\\pi \(1 + i^n x^n\)}\ \\int_0^{\\pi} \(\\cos \(x \\cos \\theta\) + i \\sin\(x \\cos \\theta\)\) \\\\ & \\qquad \(\\cosh\( x \\sin \\theta\) \\cos \(\\sin \\theta\) + i \\sinh \(x \\sin \\theta\) \\sin\(\\sin \\theta\) \) e^{\\cos \\theta} \\cos n \\theta \\, d \\theta \\\\ & \= \\frac{2}{\\pi \(1 + i^n x^n\)} \\int_0^{\\pi} \\left\( \\left\( \\cos \(x \\cos \\theta\) \\cosh \(x \\sin \\theta\) \\cos \(\\sin \\theta\) \\right. \\right. \\\\ & \\qquad \\left. - \\sin \(x \\cos \\theta\) \\sinh \(x \\sin \\theta\) \\sin \(\\sin \\\theta\) \\right\) \\\\ & \\qquad + i \\left\( \\sin \(x \\cos \\theta\) \\cosh \(x \\sin \\theta\) \\cos \(\\sin \\theta\) \\right. \\\\ & \\qquad \\left. + \\cos \(x \\cos \\theta\) \\sinh \(x \\sin \\theta\) \\sin \(\\sin \\theta\) \\right\) e^{\\cos \\\theta} \\cos n \\theta \\, d \\theta \\\\ & = \\frac{2}{\\pi \(1 + i^n x^n\)} \\int_0^{\\pi} \(C_1\(x, \\theta\) + i S_1\(x, \\theta\)\) e^{\\cos \\theta} \\cos n \\theta \\, d \\theta. \\end{aligned}\\eALT{} )/Border[0 0 0]/K 31/P 9218 0 R/Pg 1079 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj9221 0 obj<</K 34/P 9218 0 R/Pg 1079 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj9222 0 obj<</K[35 9231 0 R 38 9232 0 R 40]/P 9218 0 R/Pg 1079 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj9223 0 obj<</ActualText(\\bALT{}\\la