} && \\quad \\left. - i \(x - y\) \\sin \\theta\)^m \\right\) d \\theta \\nonumber\\\\ && = \\int_0^\\pi \\frac{1}{2} \\left\( x^2 + y^2 + 2x\y \\cos 2 \\theta \\right\)^{m / 2} \\left\( \\left\( \\frac{\(x + y\) \\cos \\theta + i \(x - y\) \\sin \\theta}{\\sqrt{x^2 + y^2 + 2xy \\cos 2 \\theta}} \\right\)^m \\right. \\nonumber \\\\ \\pg{\\noalign{\\vskip6pt}} && \\qquad \\left. + \\left\( \\fra\c{\(x + y\) \\cos \\theta - i \(x - y\) \\sin \\theta}{\\sqrt{x^2 + y^2 + 2xy \\cos 2 \\theta}} \\right\)^m \\right\) \\, d \\theta \\nonumber\\\\ \\pg{\\noalign{\\vskip6pt}} && = \\int_0^\\pi \\left\( x^2 + y^2 + 2xy \\cos 2 \\theta \\right\)^{m / 2} \\f\rac{e^{i m \\phi\(x, y, \\theta\)} + e^{-i m \\phi\(x, y, \\theta\)}}{2} \\, d \\theta \\nonumber\\\\ \\pg{\\noalign{\\vskip6pt}} && = \\int_0^\\pi \\left\( x^2 + y^2 + 2xy \\cos 2 \\theta \\right\)^{m / 2} \\cos m \\phi\(x, y, \\theta\) \\, d \\theta, \\\eALT{} )/Border[0 0 0]/K 31/P 10127 0 R/Pg 1011 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj10130 0 obj<</K 0/P 10127 0 R/Pg 1014 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj10131 0 obj<</K 3/P 10127 0 R/Pg 1014 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj10132 0 obj<</K[4 10133 0 R 7 10134 0 R 9]/P 10127 0 R/Pg 1014 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj10133 0 obj<</ActualText(\\phi\(x, y, \\theta\))/K 5/P 10132 0 R/Pg 1014 0 R/S/Span/Type/StructElem>>endobj10134 0 obj<</K 10135 0 R/P 10132 0 R/S/Reference/Type/StructElem>>endobj10135 0 obj<</Alt(Please refer Formula 5.1 your for more information)/K[<</Obj 5081 0 R/Type/OBJR>>8]/P 10134 0 R/Pg 1014 0 R/S/Link/Type/StructElem>>endobj10136 0 obj<</K 10140 0 R/P 10128 0 R/S/Reference/Type/StructElem>>endobj10137 0 obj<</ActualText(f\(z\) = z^m)/K 22/P 10128 0 R/Pg 1011 0 R/S/Span/Type/StructElem>>endobj10138 0 obj<</ActualText(\(x, y, m\) \\in \\mathbb{R} \\times \(\\mathbb{R} - {\\, -x \\,}\) \\times \(2 \\mathbb{N} - 2\))/K 25/P 10128 0 R/Pg 1011 0 R/S/Span/Type/StructElem>>endobj10139 0 obj<</ActualText(n = 0)/K 28/P 10128 0 R/Pg 101