abel{eq:12.26} \\begin{aligned} & \\int_{\\pi / 2x}^{\\pi / x} \\cos \(nx \\phi\) \\cos^m \(x \\phi\) \\, d \\phi \\\\ & = \\int_0^{\\pi / 2x} \\cos \\left\( nx \\left\( \\theta + \\frac{\\pi}{2x} \\right\) \\right\) \\cos^m \\left\( x \\left\(\ \\theta + \\frac{\\pi}{2x} \\right\) \\right\) \\, d \\theta \\\\ & = \\int_0^{\\pi / 2x} \\cos \\left\( nx \\theta + \\frac{n \\pi}{2} \\right\) \\cos^m \\left\( x \\theta + \\frac{\\pi}{2} \\right\) \\, d \\theta \\\\ & = \\int_0^{\\pi / 2x} \\cos \\le\ft\( nx \\left\( \\frac{\\pi}{2x} - \\theta \\right\) + \\frac{n \\pi}{2} \\right\) \\cos^m \\left\( x \\left\( \\frac{\\pi}{2x} - \\theta \\right\) + \\frac{\\pi}{2} \\right\) \\, d \\theta \\\\ & = \\int_0^{\\pi / 2x} \\cos \(n \\pi - nx \\theta\) \\cos\^m \(\\pi - x \\theta\) \\, d \\theta \\\\ & = \(-1\)^{m + n} \\int_0^{\\pi / 2x} \\cos \(nx \\theta\) \\cos^m \(x \\theta\) \\, d \\theta \\\\ & = \(-1\)^{m + n} \\frac{\\pi}{2^{m + 1} x} \\binom{m}{\(m - n\) / 2}. \\end{aligned}\\eALT{} )/Border[0 0 0]/K 10/P 10674 0 R/Pg 966 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj10685 0 obj<</K 13/P 10674 0 R/Pg 966 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj10686 0 obj<</K[14 10691 0 R 16 10692 0 R 18]/P 10674 0 R/Pg 966 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj10687 0 obj<</ActualText(\\bALT{}\\label{eq:12.27} \\begin{aligned} \\int_0^{\\pi / x} \\cos \(nx \\theta\) \\cos^m \(x \\theta\) \\, d \\theta & = \\left\( 1 + \(-1\)^{m + n} \\right\) \\int_0^{\\pi / 2x} \\cos \(nx \\theta\) \\cos^m \(x \\theta\) \\, d \\theta \\\\ & = \\left\(\ 1 + \(-1\)^{m + n} \\right\) \\frac{\\pi}{2^{m + 1} x} \\binom{m}{\(m - n\) / 2} \\\\ & = \\frac{\\pi}{2^{m} x} \\binom{m}{\(m - n\) / 2}, \\end{aligned}\\eALT{} )/Border[0 0 0]/K 19/P 10674 0 R/Pg 966 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj10688 0 obj<</K 22/P 10674 0 R/Pg 966 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj10689 0 obj<</K[23 10690 0 R 26]/P 10674 0 R/Pg 966 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj10690 0 obj<</ActualText(\(x, m, n\) \\in \(\\mathbb{R} - {\\, 0 \\,}\) \\times