 e^{im \\tan^{-1}\\left\( x \\sin \\theta / \(1 + x \\cos \\theta\) \\right\)} \\right. \\\\ & \\quad \\left. + e^{in \\theta} e^{-im \\tan^{-1}\\left\( x \\sin \\theta / \(1 + x \\cos \\theta\) \\right\)} \\right\)\ \\left\( 1 + x^2 + 2x \\cos \\theta \\right\)^{m / 2} \\, d \\theta \\\\ & = \\int_0^\\pi \\left\( 1 + x^2 + 2x \\cos \\theta \\right\)^{m / 2} \\cos \\left\( n \\theta - m \\tan^{-1} \\left\( \\frac{x \\sin \\theta}{1 + x \\cos \\theta} \\right\) \\righ\t\) \\, d \\theta. \\end{aligned}\\eALT{} )/Border[0 0 0]/K 12/P 11069 0 R/Pg 915 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj11072 0 obj<</K 15/P 11069 0 R/Pg 915 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj11073 0 obj<</K 11076 0 R/P 11070 0 R/S/Reference/Type/StructElem>>endobj11074 0 obj<</ActualText(f\(z\) = \(1 + xz\)^m)/K 6/P 11070 0 R/Pg 915 0 R/S/Span/Type/StructElem>>endobj11075 0 obj<</ActualText(\(x, m, n\) \\in [-1, 1] \\times \(\\mathbb{N} - 1\) \\times [0 \\ldotp \\ldotp m])/K 9/P 11070 0 R/Pg 915 0 R/S/Span/Type/StructElem>>endobj11076 0 obj<</Alt(Please refer Formula 10.9 your for more information)/K[<</Obj 4609 0 R/Type/OBJR>>4]/P 11073 0 R/Pg 915 0 R/S/Link/Type/StructElem>>endobj11077 0 obj<</Alt(Footnote )/K 5/P 9617 0 R/Pg 912 0 R/S/Lbl/Type/StructElem>>endobj11078 0 obj<</K[11079 0 R 11080 0 R]/P 9617 0 R/S/LBody/Type/StructElem>>endobj11079 0 obj<</K[6 11081 0 R 8 11082 0 R 11 11083 0 R 14 11084 0 R 16]/P 11078 0 R/Pg 912 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj11080 0 obj<</ActualText(\\bUnALT{} \\frac{\\pi}{2^m} a_n = 0 = \\int_0^\\pi \\cos \\frac{\(2n - m\) \\theta + m \\pi}{2} \\sin^m \\frac{\\theta}{2} \\, d \\theta.\\eUnALT{} )/Border[0 0 0]/K 17/P 11078 0 R/Pg 912 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj11081 0 obj<</K 11086 0 R/P 11079 0 R/S/Reference/Type/StructElem>>endobj11082 0 obj<</ActualText(f\(z\) = \(1 - z\)^m)/K 9/P 11079 0 R/Pg 912 0 R/S/Span/Type/StructElem>>endobj11083 0 obj<</ActualText(\(m, n\) \\in \(\\mathbb{N} - 1\) \\times \(\\mathbb{Z} - [0 \\ldotp \\ldotp m